sequenceDiagram
participant Maya as Maya / OIDC subject
participant Portal as CMP-001
participant Orchestrator as CMP-003
participant IAM as CMP-007
participant Agent as AGT-001 workload
participant Gateway as CMP-005 PEP
participant Tool as TOOL-004
participant Audit as CMP-009
Maya->>Portal: authenticated session (not forwarded)
Portal->>Orchestrator: task + stable human subject
Orchestrator->>IAM: token exchange request (human + workload + agent execution + case/run/task)
IAM-->>Orchestrator: short-lived audience-bound attenuated grant
Orchestrator->>Agent: grant reference + task context
Agent->>Gateway: tool request + grant + proof-of-possession
Gateway->>Gateway: signature, expiry, audience, operation, resource, data, tenant, nonce, use, revocation, approval checks
Gateway->>Gateway: blast-radius budget reservation
alt allowed
Gateway->>Tool: typed authorized invocation
Tool-->>Gateway: bounded result
Gateway->>Audit: minimized authorization evidence
Gateway-->>Agent: result
else denied
Gateway->>Audit: denial reason codes
Gateway-->>Agent: typed denial
end
